The image displays flow cytometry histograms illustrating that Nano-11 significantly enhances the expression of costimulatory molecules CD80 and CD86 on dendritic cells (DCs), with a modest increase in CD40 expression, after two days of incubation. Compared to the medium control (gray line), DCs treated with Nano-11 (black line) show a clear rightward shift in fluorescence intensity, indicating their activation and potentiation of the immune response.